  "content": "<a href=\"/\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>Organization Website</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Organization Website</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p><strong>Project Overview:</strong></p><p>BEM Aksanara is the official digital presence for the Student Executive Board at Universitas Ary Ginanjar. The goal was to transform scattered organizational data into a structured, accessible information hub.</p><p><strong>The Challenge (Problem): </strong>Student organizations often suffer from fragmented communication information is lost in social media feeds or chat groups. Stakeholders (students and campus management) lacked a single \"Source of Truth\" to verify the organization's structure, accountability, and upcoming programs.</p><p><strong>The Solution:</strong></p><ul><li>I designed a Centralized Information System focusing on clarity and transparency:</li><li>Information Architecture: I restructured the complex organizational hierarchy (Departments vs. Bureaus) into a user-friendly navigation flow, making it easy for visitors to find specific contacts.</li><li>Visual Identity: Developed a professional UI consistent with the university's branding to establish credibility.</li><li>Scalable Framework: Built on WordPress + Elementor Pro to ensure that future student cabinets can easily update content without needing to rewrite code.</li></ul>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Live Site</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://bem.uag.ac.id/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLink\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"20\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTc5NSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzIwLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImExNjI3YWEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/20.png\" alt=\"20\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"21\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTc5NiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzIxLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImExNjI3YWEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/21.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/21.png\" alt=\"21\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"22\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTc5NywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzIyLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImExNjI3YWEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/22.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/22.png\" alt=\"22\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"23\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTc5OCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzIzLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImExNjI3YWEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/23.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/23.png\" alt=\"23\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"a1627aa\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"24\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTc5OSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzI0LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImExNjI3YWEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/24.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/24.png\" alt=\"24\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result: </b>A transparent, professional platform that serves as the primary bridge between the student board and the campus community, enhancing engagement and trust.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStudent Leadership\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOrganizational Website\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t University Engagement\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInformational Platform\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWordPress CMS + Elementor Pro\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tUI/UX Structure &amp; Layouting \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tNo-Code Development \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tDynamic Section-Based Navigation\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tResponsive Web Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1486\"><p data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1486\"><strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1429\">Department Showcase</strong>: Detailed overview of all divisions and staff members.</p></li><li data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1607\"><p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1607\"><strong data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1514\">Program Highlights</strong>: Summarized content of each flagship program, including objective, audience, and timeline.</p></li><li data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1701\"><p data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1701\"><strong data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1637\">Responsive Interface</strong>: Designed for seamless use across desktop and mobile devices.</p></li><li data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1802\"><p data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1802\"><strong data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1733\">Modern Design Elements</strong>: Consistent use of color themes, typography, and visual hierarchy.</p></li></ul>"
